          "Add pumpkin, simmer 20 min",
          "Add okra, cook 10 more min",
          "Serve over funge or rice"
        ],
        "description": "Angola's national dish — chicken braised in palm oil sauce.",
        "image": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fa/Poulet_%C3%A0_la_moambe.JPG",
